      algorithm: 'Weighted feature scoring + simple trend mining tá»« Ä‘Æ¡n hÃ ng, giá» hÃ ng, wishlist, review vÃ  AI chat. ÄÃ¢y lÃ  model dá»± bÃ¡o nháº¹ cháº¡y local, khÃ´ng cáº§n thÃªm package ML.',
